# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says locally, so an
# edit script or a diff never meets a CRLF surprise. Batch files are the one exception: cmd.exe misreads LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
